    "noteZh": "README 的包表格逐行写着 @mond-design-system/react 是 40 components, self-styled, WCAG 2.2 AA、@mond-design-system/tokens 是 core scales 与 brand template，并声明 components … carry no product vocabulary；正文分 Install、Wire it up、How a rebrand works、Layout、Develop、Release 几节，Wire it up 强调加载顺序是先 tokens 再 components 最后品牌。仓库里有 .changeset、patches、PLAN.md，Releases 已经到 156 个。",
